  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The sides \\(PQ\\) and \\(PR\\) of triangle \\(PQR\\) are respectively of lengths \\(4\\) inches and \\(7\\) inches. The median \\(PM\\) is \\(3\\dfrac12\\) inches. Then \\(QR,\\) in inches, is:",
